jxZsDw4Vm4FH4vRpqVKCEceQv6fq4Cf9UA&oe=6AEF3FC0"}, "display_name": "Monsters and Mazes Halloween", "keywords": ["Monsters", "Monster", "Maze", "Horror", "Backrooms"], "long_description": "Can you escape the maze before the Monster gets you? \ud83d\udc40\n\nMonsters and Mazes is a FREE multiplayer horror game! \n\nOne player is the Monster. Everyone else has to solve the maze and RUN! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udca8\n\n\u3164\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Why Players Love Monsters and Mazes\n\n\u3164\n\n\ud83d\udc79 Be the Monster: Hunt your friends as a T-Rex, an Animatronic, Backrooms Smiler, and more!\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Escape Together: Team up, solve the maze, and find the way out!\n\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f 9 Mazes, 9 Monsters: Jungles, schools, the Backrooms, corn fields, and more!\n\n\ud83c\udd95 New Stuff Every Week: New secrets, new monsters, new skins!\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 Get YOUR Skin in the Game: Win our skin contests and see your design in the game!\n\n\u3164\n\n# \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Current Mazes & Monsters :\n- Toy Factory + Monster Toys \ud83e\uddf8\n{1097195279357544}\n- Dino Jungle + T-Rex \ud83e\udd96\n{1466563128145823}\n- Falcons High + Necro Gorgon \ud83c\udfeb\n{1406394327856553}\n- Fun Center + Gorilla Gang \ud83c\udf82\n{1658248062497338}\n- Smiler + Backrooms \ud83d\udeaa\n{674874741845817}\n- Scarecrow + Corn Maze \ud83c\udf3d\n{1432288322334268}\n- Minotaur + Labyrinth \ud83d\udc02\n{786089887612482}\n- Stalker + Dark Forest\n- Vents + Banshee \n\n\ud83d\udc49 Join 400,000+ Players!\n\nJoin our Discord for skin contests and events: https://discord.gg/aFKBDdWmah\n\nPlay FREE today... and Become the Monster! \ud83d\udc7b", "short_description": "FREE multiplayer horror! One player is the Monster. Everyone else must escape the maze! \ud83d\udc79\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/monstersandmazes/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red 